  description="The story behind GraphRace Studio, a set of browser tools for animated charts and ranking videos, and who runs it."
  heading="About GraphRace Studio"
>
  <section>
    <h2>Why we built it</h2>
    <p>GraphRace Studio is made by a data analyst who works with data every day. Data is more than a collection of numbers — when it’s visualized well, it becomes a powerful way to discover new things and tell stories.</p>
    <p>But presenting data in a way that is both beautiful and easy to understand usually takes special skills and a lot of time. We started this project to make it easy for anyone to visualize data and share it on YouTube, social media and beyond.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to help more people enjoy and share what makes data interesting, and to spark more conversations through data.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>GraphRace Studio is developed and run by an individual data analyst, not a company.</p>
    <p>Type: independent developer<br>Background: data analyst (data analysis and data visualization)</p>
    <p>As a small independent project, we can move quickly and add improvements based on your feedback.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Pricing</h2>
    <p>Every tool is free to use. If you want to export without a watermark, in high quality or with a transparent background, we offer <a href="/en/pricing" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">paid plans</a> (7-Day Pass, monthly and yearly). For commercial use of your work, see the <a href="/en/terms.html" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">Terms of Use</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Feedback &amp; contact</h2>
    <p>For feedback, feature requests, bug reports, or questions about payments and license keys, please email us at:</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;"><a href="mailto:support@graphrace-studio.com" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; word-break: break-all;">support@graphrace-studio.com</a></p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted);">When reporting a bug, it helps to include the tool name, your browser and OS, and what you were doing when it happened. For questions about a paid plan, please include the email address you used to buy it.</p>
  </section>
